{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863315583080595476","content":"Gnoblin the plover looks the blade over. \"right, i can forge weld this back together. It'll never be as strong as it was before you so carelessly snapped in twain. But 200 gold should see it done. (It will break again on a nat1)","created_at":"2021-07-13T19:21:27.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864587348981710918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
